een drawing since I was little. At first it was tough to learn, but over time I started using it to capture how I felt.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","003","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","Back then, I must have drawn the view from my window a hundred times...",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","013","music",null],["say","avg3_100","See? All those skills you built up back then are still paying off now that you're a Trekker.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","That's true. This morning's ledger commission went smoothly because of all that heir training...==W== Ah.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,"Xiao"],["ctl","avg1_137","b","014",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["tsk","Xiao"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","014",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","... So my life as a noble and as a Trekker are actually connected?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","It finally clicked, didn't it?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","013",null,"diantou"],["say","avg3_100","Continue to progress in this direction. Handle your Trekker commissions while building the skills you need as an heir.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","You gain field experience to lead a guild, while growing through your studies right now.==W== They both matter to you, don't they?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","022","star",null],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","010",null,"lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Your time and energy are limited, obviously. The trick is improving your efficiency and picking commissions that actually suit you.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","011","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg1_137","You're amazing, Mentor!==W== I never thought to look at it that way!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","007",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_101"],["ctl","avg1_137","b","014",null,null,-0.25,1.3,null,"diantou","OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_137","I always assumed being a Trekker and being a noble were polar opposites...==W== I ran away back then because I felt a sheltered girl who never left her house could never become a real Trekker...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","006","happy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","But now I know they don't actually clash. They feed off each other. Even a noble lady can become a Trekker one day!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","There you go with \"one day\" again...==W== You're already well on your way to achieving that dream, aren't you?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","020",null,"lengzhan"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","022","music",null],["say","avg3_100","From now on, manage your time well. Align your Trekker goals and your noble duties.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","Yeah!==W== I feel a lot more confident all of a sudden. Though...==W== Heh heh, wanting to be both an excellent Trekker and a graceful lady... Is that a little too greedy?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","015","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","008",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","What's wrong with being a little greedy?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","018",null,"diantou"],["say","avg3_100","Being a Trekker is all about freedom. You never have to limit your own potential.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],[